  "description": "The Korean War. The story of Korean soldiers fighting together in a foreign legion of different nations and races.\n\nDuring the Korean War, the Korean soldiers and civilians assigned to the French battalion transported supplies as the 'Porter Unit'. At first, the French soldiers seemed distant, but as the battles continued, they became close and eventually became comrades who were more relied on than anyone else. The story of them fighting as one despite being from different countries and races.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
